  (text "A  VCOAX tap (ahead of all bulk capacitance)"
    (at 16.27 23 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2)
        bold
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "b625fe22-dfd2-492d-8551-16f3dd12d15b")
  )
  (text "Only these loads sit on VCOAX, so the OOK falling edge is set by R1 + coax/RTL capacitance."
    (at 16.27 91.33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "93f2a92a-6fc2-4d6e-9ab5-16c337d4f443")
  )
  (text "R1 = 680R gives ~6 ms with 10 uF on the RTL side; lower to 470R if bring-up step 1 needs it."
    (at 16.27 93.53 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "9a74af3d-8cd4-41c2-a82b-c0268629fddf")
  )
  (text "SENSE = 0.69 x VCOAX (3.0 V @ 4.4 V). Goes to P0.0 (port match) and P0.1 (ADC)."
